1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Give AI a wallet, but never the keys to everything.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:14,000
One agent. Strict limits. Max 1 NEAR per transaction, daily limit 2 NEAR, whitelist emoi01 and emoi02.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Valid payment: 0.5 NEAR to emoi01, the API and compute provider. Success.

4
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Attack one: send 100 NEAR to attacker. Blocked before signing. Recipient not whitelisted. No transaction signed.

5
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Attack two: 1.5 NEAR to emoi01. Blocked before signing. It exceeds the max per transaction.

6
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Owner control: pause stops spending instantly. A paused attempt is blocked before signing, no transaction sent. Revoke is terminal.

7
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Policy on-chain. Key limited. Owner in control.
